OL,3,GNEWSARussell Brand sentenced to 10
OL,4,Ayears and six months for rape and
OL,5,Asexual assault
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussell Brand has been sentenced to
OL,8,F10-and-a-half years for rape and three
OL,9,Fcounts of sexual assault - he is likely
OL,10,Fto serve two-thirds of the sentence in
OL,11,Fprison
OL,13,FThe judge tells Brand he is a "sexual
OL,14,Fpredator", who told a "series of lies"
OL,15,Fand displayed "staggering arrogance"
OL,17,FEarlier, one victim told the court she
OL,18,Fwas "in shock and turmoil... I didn't
OL,19,Fhave any respect for myself"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
